    {
      "key": "blog_detail_3ec80043fb9f",
      "text": "Your restaurant’s homepage isn’t just a digital front door; it’s often the first impression you make with a hungry customer searching nearby. And when it comes to showing up in Google’s Map Pack or driving more online reservations, local SEO is one of the smartest tools in your marketing kit.\n\nThis guide walks you through the most critical (and often overlooked) ways to optimize your restaurant homepage so you’re showing up when and where it matters most: right in your neighborhood.",
